      <activity id="f9841c72-9440-52dc-8183-860a139bf82b" activityNameId="5b095bb9-1e6a-5ec1-b016-ee65fe3ccdfa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Potassium perchlorate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potassium perchlorate, at plant
The process "potassium perchlorate, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  potassium perchlorate from sodium perchlorate in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 007778-74-7; 
Formula: KClO4; 
Synonyms: perchlorated potassium; 
UUID: 7ccf0c1a-d92c-3477-a77d-7b9c99ed4374
Production of potassium perchlorate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Reaction of sodium perchlorate and potassium chloride
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ccf0c1a-d92c-3477-a77d-7b9c99ed4374.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
